## 2b. Expiry register

Every date-sensitive element carried by the prior response, in one table — reference projects,
financial-year figures, insurance evidence, CV project dates, URLs, attestations. "It was true
last time" is how a bid fails a minimum requirement, and these items expire *between* the two
submissions even when the clause text is unchanged. Found on the real GNI re-issue: 9 items
expired or slid between 25-057 and 26-002 (FY24→FY25 accounts, a 5-year H&S table dropping a
year, a Modern Slavery URL already stale at the first submission).

| Item | Prior value | This tender's rule | Verdict | Owner |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| <e.g. reference project completion> | <2022-06> | within 3 years of submission | ❌ expired / ⚠ borderline / ✅ valid | <name> |

